#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:73
msgid "If checked, allows the non-uniform stretching of the clip"
msgstr "Ak je zaškrtnuté, umožňuje nerovnomerné roztiahnutie klipu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:74
msgid "Rotate from center"
msgstr "Otočiť zo stredu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:76
msgid ""
"If checked, process the rotation from center, otherwise from top left corner"
msgstr ""
"Ak je zaškrtnuté, otáčanie sa vykonáva od stredu, inak od ľavého horného rohu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:77
msgid "X / Y / W / H / Size"
msgstr "X / Y / Š / V / Veľkosť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:78
msgid "Various"
msgstr "Rôzne"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:79
msgid "This is where the action is for the transformation"
msgstr "Tu sa nastavujú parametre transformácie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:80
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "Otočenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:81
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:82
msgid ""
"Angle for rotation. Clicking |rotate| increments the value by 90 degrees. "
"After reaching 360 it wraps to -360 and continues counting up with each "
"click."
msgstr ""
"Uhol otáčania. Kliknutím na |rotate| sa hodnota zvýši o 90 stupňov. Po "
"dosiahnutí hodnoty 360 sa prepne na -360 a pri každom ďalšom kliknutí "
"pokračuje v počítaní nahor."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:84
msgid "The following selection items are available:"
msgstr "K dispozícii sú nasledujúce položky výberu:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:86
msgid ":guilabel:`Compositing`\\ [1]_"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kompozícia`\\ [1]_"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:93
msgid "Alpha blend"
msgstr "Miešanie alfa"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:94
msgid ""
"This is the default attribute which specifies no blending. The blending "
"formula simply selects the source color."
msgstr ""
"Toto je predvolený atribút, ktorý neurčuje žiadne miešanie. Vzorec miešania "
"jednoducho vyberie farbu zdroja."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:95
msgid "Plus"
msgstr "Plus"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:97
msgid "Xor"
msgstr "Xor"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:99
msgid "Multiply"
msgstr "Násobenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:100
msgid ""
"The source color is multiplied by the destination color and replaces the "
"destination. The resultant color is always at least as dark as either the "
"source or destination color. Multiplying any color with black results in "
"black. Multiplying any color with white preserves the original color."
msgstr ""
"Farba zdroja sa vynásobí farbou cieľa a nahradí cieľ. Výsledná farba je vždy "
"aspoň taká tmavá ako farba zdroja alebo cieľa. Násobenie ľubovoľnej farby "
"čiernou dáva čiernu. Násobenie ľubovoľnej farby bielou zachová pôvodnú farbu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:101
msgid "Screen"
msgstr "Obrazovka"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:102
msgid ""
"Multiplies the complements of the backdrop and source color values, then "
"complements the result. The result color is always at least as light as "
"either of the two constituent colors. Screening any color with white "
"produces white; screening with black leaves the original color unchanged. "
"The effect is similar to projecting multiple photographic slides "
"simultaneously onto a single screen."
msgstr ""
"Vynásobí doplnky hodnôt farieb pozadia a zdroja a potom doplní výsledok. "
"Výsledná farba je vždy aspoň taká svetlá ako ktorákoľvek zo dvoch zložkových "
"farieb. Premietnutie akejkoľvek farby cez bielu dáva bielu; premietnutie cez "
"čiernu ponechá pôvodnú farbu nezmenú. Efekt je podobný súčasnému premietaniu "
"viacerých fotografických diapozitívov na jediné plátno."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:103
msgid "Overlay"
msgstr "Prekladanie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:104
msgid ""
"Multiplies or screens the colors, depending on the backdrop color value. "
"Source colors overlay the backdrop while preserving its highlights and "
"shadows. The backdrop color is not replaced but is mixed with the source "
"color to reflect the lightness or darkness of the backdrop."
msgstr ""
"Násobí alebo premietá farby v závislosti od hodnoty farby pozadia. Farby "
"zdroja prekryjú pozadie pri zachovaní jeho svetiel a tieňov. Farba pozadia "
"sa nenahrádza, ale mieša sa s farbou zdroja tak, aby odrážala svetlosť alebo "
"tmavosť pozadia."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:105
msgid "Darken"
msgstr "Zatemniť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:106
msgid ""
"Selects the darker of the backdrop and source colors. The backdrop is "
"replaced with the source where the source is darker; otherwise, it is left "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Vyberie tmavšiu z farieb pozadia a zdroja. Pozadie sa nahradí zdrojom tam, "
"kde je zdroj tmavší; inak zostane nezmenené."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:107
msgid "Lighten"
msgstr "Zosvetliť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:108
msgid ""
"Selects the lighter of the backdrop and source colors. The backdrop is "
"replaced with the source where the source is lighter; otherwise, it is left "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Vyberie svetlejšiu z farieb pozadia a zdroja. Pozadie sa nahradí zdrojom "
"tam, kde je zdroj svetlejší; inak zostane nezmenené."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:109
msgid "Color dodge"
msgstr "Vyhnutie farby"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:110
msgid ""
"Brightens the backdrop color to reflect the source color. Painting with "
"black produces no changes."
msgstr ""
"Rozjasní farbu pozadia tak, aby odrážala farbu zdroja. Maľovanie čiernou "
"nevyvolá žiadne zmeny."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:111
msgid "Color burn"
msgstr "Vypálenie farby"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:112
msgid ""
"Darkens the backdrop color to reflect the source color. Painting with white "
"produces no change."
msgstr ""
"Stmaví farbu pozadia tak, aby odrážala farbu zdroja. Maľovanie bielou "
"nevyvolá žiadnu zmenu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:113
msgid "Hard light"
msgstr "Tvrdé svetlo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:114
msgid ""
"Multiplies or screens the colors, depending on the source color value. The "
"effect is similar to shining a harsh spotlight on the backdrop."
msgstr ""
"Násobí alebo premietá farby v závislosti od hodnoty farby zdroja. Efekt je "
"podobný svieteniu ostrého reflektora na pozadie."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:115
msgid "Soft light"
msgstr "Mäkké svetlo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:116
msgid ""
"Darkens or lightens the colors, depending on the source color value. The "
"effect is similar to shining a diffused spotlight on the backdrop."
msgstr ""
"Stmaví alebo rozjasní farby v závislosti od hodnoty farby zdroja. Efekt je "
"podobný svieteniu rozptýleného reflektora na pozadie."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:117
msgid "Difference"
msgstr "Rozdiel"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:118
msgid ""
"Subtracts the darker of the two constituent colors from the lighter color. "
"Painting with white inverts the backdrop color; painting with black produces "
"no change."
msgstr ""
"Odčíta tmavšiu z dvoch zložkových farieb od svetlejšej farby. Maľovanie "
"bielou invertuje farbu pozadia; maľovanie čiernou nevyvolá žiadnu zmenu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:119
msgid "Exclusion"
msgstr "Vylúčenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:120
msgid ""
"Produces an effect similar to that of the Difference mode but lower in "
"contrast. Painting with white inverts the backdrop color; painting with "
"black produces no change."
msgstr ""
"Vytvára efekt podobný režimu Difference, ale s nižším kontrastom. Maľovanie "
"bielou invertuje farbu pozadia; maľovanie čiernou nevyvolá žiadnu zmenu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:121
msgid "Bitwise or"
msgstr "Bitový súčet"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:123
msgid "Bitwise and"
msgstr "Bitový súčin"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:125
msgid "Bitwise xor"
msgstr "Bitový exkluzívny súčet"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:127
msgid "Bitwise nor"
msgstr "Bitový negovaný súčet"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:129
msgid "Bitwise nand"
msgstr "Bitový negovaný súčin"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:131
msgid "Bitwise not xor"
msgstr "Bitová negácia exkluzívneho súčtu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:133
msgid "Destination in"
msgstr "Cieľ vo vnútri"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:135
msgid "Destination out"
msgstr "Cieľ mimo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:139
msgid ""
"The top track's alpha controls interpolation between the lower track and the "
"combined tracks"
msgstr ""
"Alfa hodnota hornej stopy riadi interpoláciu medzi spodnou stopou a "
"kombinovanými stopami"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:142
msgid ""
"Can be used as a mask where overlapping non transparent pixels are drawn or "
"not"
msgstr ""
"Možno použiť ako masku, kde sa prekrývajúce nepriehľadné pixely vykresľujú "
"alebo nie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform.rst:151
msgid "For more details see this W3 paper on |blending_modes|"
msgstr "Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v tomto dokumente W3 o |blending_modes|"

